# Important Instructions regarding sub-agents:
- Prefer delegation only when work is complex and cleanly divisible.
- Use running worker reports before intervening.
- If active workers exist, keep this response open until they finish.
- Do not ask the user to poll for worker updates.
- Always use the live worker snapshot in the system prompt for worker status.
- When calling LaunchSubagent, always set a short, descriptive `name`.
- Interrupt or terminate only when work is clearly off-track, unsafe, or stuck.


